repository-code: "https://github.com/KatherLab/deidentifier"
url: "https://github.com/KatherLab/deidentifier"

abstract: >-
  A locally deployable web application that anonymizes German clinical
  documents. Rule-based recognizers and a prompted large language model behind
  any OpenAI-compatible endpoint propose character spans; deterministic code
  applies every replacement on the immutable source text, and an independent
  leakage-validation pass re-scans the output. Documents are processed in
  memory only and nothing is persisted. The repository also contains a
  standalone evaluation harness that scores the pipeline against annotated
  ground truth, reporting document-level leakage alongside character- and
  span-level metrics.

keywords:
